# Certificate only, everything inline.
client
dev tun
proto udp
remote vpn.example.net 1194
<ca>
-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
MIIBsyntheticTESTCA
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
</ca>
<cert>
-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
MIIBsyntheticTESTCLIENT
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
</cert>
<key>
-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
MIGHsyntheticTESTKEY
-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
</key>
